<!--
  Every user-visible string in N13.

  The default file is English; values-fa/ carries the Persian translation of the
  same keys.  Keys are grouped by the screen or component that uses them so a
  translation can be reviewed without hunting through the code.

  Note on direction: these strings are UI prose and follow the app's layout
  direction.  Technical values (URLs, paths, file names, checksums, byte counts)
  are *not* here — they are data, and they are pinned left-to-right in the UI by
  N13Ltr / N13LtrText.
-->
